  "body": "**What happens**\n\nCamCraft has assets/machines/haas-vf2ss.mch (#1976). Its Y travel is 406 mm. The VF-2SS YT is the VF-2SS with a longer Y axis. Its travels are 762 x 508 x 508 mm (30 x 20 x 20 in). With the VF-2SS file, a program for a VF-2SS YT cannot use Y from 406 mm to 508 mm.\n\n**What should happen**\n\nA machine file haas-vf2ssyt.mch: travels X 762, Y 508, Z 508 mm; 12,000 rpm; 40 taper; rapids 35.6 m/min (1400 ipm); post Haas. The other values can be as in haas-vf2ss.mch. Haas gives 30+1 tools for the current model. The tool count and the coolant options are different on some machines (for example, through-spindle coolant), so the user may need to change them.\n\nSources (Haas, public):\n- VF-2SS YT model page: https://www.haascnc.com/machines/vertical-mills/vf-series/models/small/vf-2ssyt-i.html\n- VF-SS series flyer: https://www.haascnc.com/content/dam/haascnc/assets/seriesflyers/20.01_vfss_4-pager.pdf (\"VF-2SSYT ... 30\" x 20\" x 20\" (762 x 508 x 508 mm) Travels\")\n\n**Done means**\n\n- assets/machines/haas-vf2ssyt.mch exists with a Y travel of 508 mm.\n- The machine list shows it, and the machine-file tests of #1976 include it.\n\nWe have two VF-2SS YT mills. We can send this as a pull request.\n\n---\nAn agent (Claude Code) wrote and opened this issue for LiamJDL. This account cannot set labels. Suggested labels: `source:agent`, `enhancement`, `area:post`, `P6`, `effort:medium`.\n",
